function autoEnc(sp){const s=getSrc(sp.src);if(!s)return sp;const T0=V.types[sp.type],dk=T0&&DK[T0.demo.k];if(dk&&dk.src===sp.src){sp.enc=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(dk.enc));sp.agg=dk.agg||"";if(dk.grain)sp.grain=dk.grain;return sp}
 const cats=s.fields.filter(f=>f.t==="c"&&!f.hc&&!f.geo),dates=s.fields.filter(f=>f.t==="d"),nums=s.fields.filter(f=>f.t==="n"&&!f.geo),geos=s.fields.filter(f=>f.geo&&f.t==="c"),fam=T0?T0.fam:"",en={},k2=T0&&/^(c2|c2b|c3|ts2|sm)$/.test(T0.demo.k);
 if(/^(Line|Time and process|Finance and quality)$/.test(fam)&&dates[0]){en.x=dates[0].k;if(nums[0])en.y=nums[0].k}else if(fam==="Maps"){if(geos[0])en.x=geos[0].k}else if(fam==="Scatter and density"||fam==="Distribution"&&!cats[0]){en.x=nums[0]&&nums[0].k;en.y=nums[1]&&nums[1].k}else if(fam==="Distribution"){en.x=cats[0].k;en.y=nums[0]&&nums[0].k}else{en.x=(cats[0]||dates[0]||{}).k;if(nums[0])en.y=nums[0].k}
 if(k2&&cats[1])en.color=cats[1].k;if(fam==="Line"&&T0.demo.k==="ts2"&&cats[0])en.color=cats[0].k;Object.keys(en).forEach(k=>{if(!en[k])delete en[k]});sp.enc=en;sp.agg="";return sp}
function openBuilder(sp,id){Z.bld={spec:norm(JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(sp))),id:id||null};S.v.viz_v=3;audit("opened visual in builder",sp.title||sp.type);render();setTimeout(()=>{const n=document.querySelector("[data-viz-bld]");if(n)n.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"})},80)}
